Alibaba Cloud AI Hackathon Pakistan 2026

THE SUBMISSION PORTAL IS OPEN. HERE IS YOUR ACCOUNT.

You are getting this because your project qualified and you registered as
the team lead. This is where you submit it.

Set a password to open your account. Everything from here happens in the
portal.

Open this link to set your password:

https://aihackathon.cognix-pk.com/auth/confirm?token_hash=3D9fd71da91dbc4b0=
1c9aff23491867a4984f727188340d6e5d5177086&type=3Dinvite

LINK EXPIRED, OR ALREADY USED?

Go to https://aihackathon.cognix-pk.com/forgot-password, enter this same em=
ail address, and
you will get a fresh link to set your password. You do not need this
message again.

IN THE PORTAL YOU CAN

  * Submit your project: GitHub repository, slides and a short write-up
  * Ask the organisers a question and get a written reply
  * Pick up your event pass and your presentation time
  * See your result once judging is done

Nothing is final until you press Submit. Save a draft and come back
later. That is fine. All the dates, including the deadline, are in the
portal.

ONE ACCOUNT PER PROJECT

It belongs to whoever registered as team lead. Your teammates do not
need their own logins. If you registered two projects, you will get two
of these emails.

NEED HELP?

If you can sign in, use Queries in the portal. That is the fastest way
and we answer you right there.

If you cannot sign in, email aihackathon@banoqabil.pk and we will help
you.

This message is sent automatically, so please use one of those two
rather than replying to it.

--
https://www.linkedin.com/company/cognix-pk/

You are getting this because you registered a project for the Alibaba
Cloud AI Hackathon Pakistan 2026 and it qualified. Please do not forward
this link. Anyone who opens it can set the password on your team's
account.

